     <SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"><FONT face=宋体><A href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202008/2020082310570725.jpg" target=_blank>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><BR><BR><IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202008/2020082310570725.jpg" width=1200 height=801> </A></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000">为进一步</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体"><FONT face=宋体>统一思想，明确工作目标任务，提升工作能力水平</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"><FONT face=宋体>，</FONT>8<FONT face=宋体>月</FONT><FONT face=Calibri>14</FONT><FONT face=宋体>日，绍兴一中组织</FONT><FONT face=Calibri>2020</FONT><FONT face=宋体>年暑期中层读书会。本次中层读书会是学校完成中层干部选聘调整后的首次集中学习。校党委书记、校长王琛为读书会做专题主旨讲话。校领导班子及全体中层处室副职以上干部、年级长、支部书记、后备干部等与会。</FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"><?xml:namespace prefix = "o" ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p><IMG onload=resizepic(this) style="BORDER-TOP-COLOR: ; BORDER-LEFT-COLOR: ; BORDER-BOTTOM-COLOR: ; BORDER-RIGHT-COLOR: " onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202008/2020082310581511.jpg"><BR><BR><IMG onload=resizepic(this) style="BORDER-TOP-COLOR: ; BORDER-LEFT-COLOR: ; BORDER-BOTTOM-COLOR: ; BORDER-RIGHT-COLOR: " onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202008/2020082310581502.jpg"><BR><BR><IMG onload=resizepic(this) style="BORDER-TOP-COLOR: ; BORDER-LEFT-COLOR: ; BORDER-BOTTOM-COLOR: ; BORDER-RIGHT-COLOR: " onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202008/2020082310581561.jpg"><BR><BR><IMG onload=resizepic(this) style="BORDER-TOP-COLOR: ; BORDER-LEFT-COLOR: ; BORDER-BOTTOM-COLOR: ; BORDER-RIGHT-COLOR: " onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202008/2020082310581501.jpg"><BR><BR><IMG onload=resizepic(this) style="BORDER-TOP-COLOR: ; BORDER-LEFT-COLOR: ; BORDER-BOTTOM-COLOR: ; BORDER-RIGHT-COLOR: " onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202008/2020082310581582.jpg"><BR><BR><IMG onload=resizepic(this) style="BORDER-TOP-COLOR: ; BORDER-LEFT-COLOR: ; BORDER-BOTTOM-COLOR: ; BORDER-RIGHT-COLOR: " onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202008/2020082310581564.jpg"><BR><BR><IMG onload=resizepic(this) style="BORDER-TOP-COLOR: ; BORDER-LEFT-COLOR: ; BORDER-BOTTOM-COLOR: ; BORDER-RIGHT-COLOR: " onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202008/2020082310581591.jpg"><BR><BR><IMG onload=resizepic(this) style="BORDER-TOP-COLOR: ; BORDER-LEFT-COLOR: ; BORDER-BOTTOM-COLOR: ; BORDER-RIGHT-COLOR: " onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202008/2020082310581518.jpg"><BR></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"><FONT face=宋体>本次读书会为期一天，</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体"><FONT face=宋体>围绕</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">“</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体"><FONT face=宋体>加强现代治理能力，争创省现代化学校</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">”</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体"><FONT face=宋体>主题，立足学校</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"><FONT face=宋体>近期工作和</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体"><FONT face=宋体>未来发展，就如何提升各处室部门</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"><FONT face=宋体>管</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体"><FONT face=宋体>理</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"><FONT face=宋体>、</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体"><FONT face=宋体>服务水平，如何高质量完成学校发展</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"><FONT face=宋体>的</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体"><FONT face=宋体>近期目标和具体任务，通过</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"><FONT face=宋体>处室工作交流研讨、专家报告和领导主旨讲话等形式</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体"><FONT face=宋体>，</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"><FONT face=宋体>为与会者带来思想启发，促进能力</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体"><FONT face=宋体>提升。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"><FONT face=宋体>在上午的工作交流环节，党政办、教学处、德育处、总务处、信息处、教科室、团委等处室部门交流了</FONT>2020<FONT face=宋体>学年第一学期处室重点工作计划，围绕学校年度重点工作目标梳理了各线办的具体工作任务。</FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"><o:p><IMG onload=resizepic(this) style="BORDER-TOP-COLOR: ; BORDER-LEFT-COLOR: ; BORDER-BOTTOM-COLOR: ; BORDER-RIGHT-COLOR: " onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202008/2020082310595414.jpg"><BR><BR><IMG onload=resizepic(this) style="BORDER-TOP-COLOR: ; BORDER-LEFT-COLOR: ; BORDER-BOTTOM-COLOR: ; BORDER-RIGHT-COLOR: " onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202008/2020082310595412.jpg"><BR><BR><IMG onload=resizepic(this) style="BORDER-TOP-COLOR: ; BORDER-LEFT-COLOR: ; BORDER-BOTTOM-COLOR: ; BORDER-RIGHT-COLOR: " onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202008/2020082310595489.jpg"><BR><BR><IMG onload=resizepic(this) style="BORDER-TOP-COLOR: ; BORDER-LEFT-COLOR: ; BORDER-BOTTOM-COLOR: ; BORDER-RIGHT-COLOR: " onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202008/2020082310595429.jpg"><BR><BR><IMG onload=resizepic(this) style="BORDER-TOP-COLOR: ; BORDER-LEFT-COLOR: ; BORDER-BOTTOM-COLOR: ; BORDER-RIGHT-COLOR: " onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202008/2020082310595411.jpg"><BR></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"><FONT face=宋体>随后在专家报告环节，教育专家田光成教授为全体与会人员带来培训报告《赢在执行</FONT>——提升学校管理团队执行力》。报告通过丰富的典型案例，启发大家思考今天的基础教育如何发展；并围绕“执行力话题”，组织多轮分组讨论，明确“执行力就是一个组织的核心竞争力”。田教授还通过解析执行力判断标准，进一步阐明影响执行力的各种因素，并指出提升执行力的具体策略。</SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"><o:p><A href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202008/2020082311001659.jpg" target=_blank><IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202008/2020082311001659.jpg" width=1200 height=801> </A></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"><FONT face=宋体>在下午的领导主旨讲话环节，王琛着眼处室部门自身建设、协作水平和创新能力，在讲话中着重强调了三个方面的内容：</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"><FONT face=宋体>一是要以</FONT>“学术思维”引领“任务思维”，切实提高工作效率和专业水平。他强调，中层干部要学会顶层设计思维，善于阅读上级文件，领会政策精神。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"><FONT face=宋体>二是要以</FONT>“目标导向”引领“问题导向”，切实把握工作方向和专业重点。他对照学校<FONT face=Calibri>2020</FONT><FONT face=宋体>年度的工作目标，结合今年的高考成绩，深入剖析了当下的工作形势，在已经实现的年度目标基础上提出了</FONT><FONT face=Calibri>2021</FONT><FONT face=宋体>年高考“四超一领先”的新目标，并向各处室具体布置了</FONT><FONT face=Calibri>26</FONT><FONT face=宋体>项工作任务。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"><FONT face=宋体>三是要以</FONT>“纪律要求”引领“工作要求”，切实提升工作能力和专业作风。他强调，学校党员干部的一言一行都代表着学校的正气形象，要根据“清廉学校”建设方案的要求，做到工作阳光操作、个人坦诚坦率。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"><FONT face=宋体>最后，他希望，全体管理团队抛开顾虑、不忘初心，既为一中学子的未来、一中的未来，也为自我价值理想展现，快乐工作，幸福生活！</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"><FONT face=宋体>据悉，本次读书会是年度读书会的第一阶段理论学习，后续还将择机安排</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体"><FONT face=宋体>第二阶段</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"><FONT face=宋体>的</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体"><FONT face=宋体>实践学习，主要通过实地考察，借鉴优秀学校办学经验和办事水平，提升各处室部门的治理能力。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
    
